      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Dritte Formel",
        "markdown": "$36x^2 - 1 = (6x)^2 - 1^2$"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t5",
      "type": "task-numeric",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Berechne im Kopf mit einer binomischen Formel: $98^2$",
        "expected": "9604",
        "tolerance": "exact",
        "decimalSeparator": "both",
        "allowExpression": false,
        "valueFeedback": [
          {
            "value": "9404",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "Mittelglied: 2 · 100 · 2 = 400, und dann + 2² = 4.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          },
          {
            "value": "9596",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "Das letzte Glied +4 wird addiert.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          }
        ],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 700
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t5",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 700
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Zerlegen",
        "markdown": "$98^2 = (100 - 2)^2 = 10000 - 400 + 4$"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t6",
      "type": "task-math",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Vereinfache.",
        "latex": "(x+1)^2-(x-1)^2=\\placeholder[b]{}x",
        "blanks": {
          "b": {
            "expected": "4",
            "accepted": []
          }
        },
        "compare": "symbolic",
        "partialCredit": false,
        "virtualKeyboard": true,
        "blankFeedback": [
          {
            "blank": "b",
            "latex": "2",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "Vergiss das Minus vor der Klammer nicht: −(x² − 2x + 1) = −x² + 2x − 1.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          }
        ],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 840
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t6",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 840
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Schritt für Schritt",
        "markdown": "$(x^2 + 2x + 1) - (x^2 - 2x + 1)$\n\nDas Minus vor der Klammer dreht alle Vorzeichen um: $x^2 + 2x + 1 - x^2 + 2x - 1$"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t7",
      "type": "task-numeric",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Löse die Gleichung $(x+2)^2 = x^2 + 16$. Gib $x$ an.",
        "expected": "3",
        "tolerance": "exact",
        "decimalSeparator": "both",
        "allowExpression": false,
        "valueFeedback": [
          {
            "value": "4",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "Links steht x² + 4x + 4. Dann bleibt 4x + 4 = 16.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          }
        ],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 980
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t7",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 980
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Erst ausmultiplizieren",
        "markdown": "$x^2 + 4x + 4 = x^2 + 16$\n\n$x^2$ fällt auf beiden Seiten weg: $4x + 4 = 16$"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t8",
      "type": "task-yes-no",
      "data": {
        "question": "Stimmt das? $(-a-b)^2 = (a+b)^2$",
        "correctAnswer": true,
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1120
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t8",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 1120
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Minus ausklammern",
        "markdown": "$-a - b = -(a + b)$. Beim Quadrieren gilt $(-1)^2 = 1$, das Minus verschwindet."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ende",
      "type": "end-tries",
      "position": {
